# Request: switch the supervisor to a target mode.
# mode: one of "idle", "slam_2d", "slam_3d", "loc_2d", "loc_3d"
# map_file: required when mode == "loc_2d" (path without .posegraph extension)
# database_path: optional override for "slam_3d"/"loc_3d" rtabmap database (default ~/rtabmap_maps/rtabmap.db)
# load_all_nodes: slam_3d only — load the whole existing db into working
#   memory at start (Mem/InitWMWithAllNodes), so an incremental mapping
#   session relocalizes and merges immediately instead of drifting until
#   the first loop closure. Ignored by other modes.
string mode
string map_file
string database_path
bool load_all_nodes
---
bool success
string message
string current_mode
